 be doing it. Looks like they switched from `svgcleaner` to `svgo` but didn't change it in https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/editor/creating_icons.html.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2452597084/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2463405742","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98681#issuecomment-2463405742","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98681","id":2463405742,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6S1Jau","user":{"login":"RLCcar","id":112604338,"node_id":"U_kgDOBrY0sg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112604338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RLCcar","html_url":"https://github.com/RLCcar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RLCcar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RLCcar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RLCcar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RLCcar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RLCcar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RLCcar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RLCcar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RLCcar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RLCcar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-07T23:11:53Z","updated_at":"2024-11-07T23:11:53Z","body":"It appears `Static checks` and `Linux / Editor w/ Mono` have contradicting complaints with the XML documentation.\r\n\r\n`Static checks` required that the HGridContainer and the VGridContainer XML contained definitions for the `rows` and `columns` variables, but `Linux / Editor w/ Mono` demands I remove them.\r\n\r\nIs it a deeper issue with how the variables are configured, or an issue with Linux Mono?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2463405742/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2463426751","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98681#issuecomment-2463426751","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98681","id":2463426751,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6S1Oi_","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-07T23:30:56Z","updated_at":"2024-11-07T23:31:40Z","body":"The CI log says:\r\n\r\n> Running --doctool to see if this changes the public API without updating the documentation.\r\nIf a diff is shown, it means that your code/doc changes are incomplete and you should update the class reference with --doctool.\r\n\r\nCompile a Godot binary locally and run the `--doctool` command line argument on it to update the class reference XML locally. After doing this, `git commit -a --amend` your changes.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2463426751/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2465144115","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98681#issuecomment-2465144115","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98681","id":2465144115,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6S7x0z","user":{"login":"RLCcar","id":112604338,"node_id":"U_kgDOBrY0sg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112604338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RLCcar","html_url":"https://github.com/RLCcar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RLCcar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RLCcar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RLCcar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RLCcar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RLCcar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RLCcar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RLCcar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RLCcar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RLCcar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-08T16:10:42Z","updated_at":"2024-11-08T16:10:42Z","body":"> It appears `Static checks` and `Linux / Editor w/ Mono` have contradicting complaints with the XML documentation.\r\n> \r\n> `Static checks` required that the HGridContainer and the VGridContainer XML contained definitions for the `rows` and `columns` variables, but `Linux / Editor w/ Mono` demands I remove them.\r\n\r\nI've ran the `--doctool` command and pushed my new changes, but the original problem still stands: `Static Checks` and `Linux / Editor w/ Mono` contradict each other.\r\n\r\nI'm trying to figure out why `Static Checks` demands that ***HBoxContainer* and *VGridContainer* must include *GridContainer* properties in the documentation**, even though it doesn't for other classes with horizontal/vertical variants. Am I missing something for the new classes?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2465144115/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2465254955","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98681#issuecomment-2465254955","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98681","id":2465254955,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6S8M4r","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-08T16:47:50Z","updated_at":"2024-11-08T16:49:12Z","body":"> > It appears `Static checks` and `Linux / Editor w/ Mono` have contradicting complaints with the XML documentation.\r\n> > `Static checks` required that the HGridContainer and the VGridContainer XML contained definitions for the `rows` and `columns` variables, but `Linux / Editor w/ Mono` demands I remove them.\r\n> \r\n> I've ran the `--doctool` command and pushed my new changes, but the original problem still stands: `Static Checks` and `Linux / Editor w/ Mono` contradict each other.\r\n> \r\n> I'm trying to figure out why `Static Checks` demands that **_HBoxContainer_ and _VGridContainer_ must include _GridContainer_ properties in the documentation**, even though it doesn't for other classes with horizontal/vertical variants. Am I missing something for the new classes?\r\n\r\nI just found out. That's because the checks think that you refer to members `{H,V}BoxContainer.{rows,columns}`, but they don't exist. You need to specify that the member is from another class. Here's the diff to correct your issues:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/doc/classes/HGridContainer.xml b/doc/classes/HGridContainer.xml\r\nindex 09f113035f..8a7cf007be 100644\r\n--- a/doc/classes/HGridContainer.xml\r\n+++ b/doc/classes/HGridContainer.xml\r\n@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@\r\n \t\tA container that arranges its child controls in a grid layout horizontally.\r\n \t</brief_description>\r\n \t<description>\r\n-\t\tA variant of [GridContainer] that can only arrange its child controls horizontally, with a set number of [member rows], and a changing number of [member columns].\r\n+\t\tA variant of [GridContainer] that can only arrange its child controls horizontally, with a set number of [member GridContainer.rows], and a changing number of [member GridContainer.columns].\r\n \t\tChild controls are rearranged automatically when their minimum size changes.\r\n \t</description>\r\n \t<tutorials>\r\ndiff --git a/doc/classes/VGridContainer.xml b/doc/classes/VGridContainer.xml\r\nindex 5eb54b4cbf..fb86b3e41a 100644\r\n--- a/doc/classes/VGridContainer.xml\r\n+++ b/doc/classes/VGridContainer.xml\r\n@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@\r\n \t\tA container that arranges its child controls in a grid layout vertically.\r\n \t</brief_description>\r\n \t<description>\r\n-\t\tA variant of [GridContainer] that can only arrange its child controls vertically, with a set number of [member columns], and a changing number of [member rows].\r\n+\t\tA variant of [GridContainer] that can only arrange its child controls vertically, with a set number of [member GridContainer.columns], and a changing number of [member GridContainer.rows].\r\n \t\tChild controls are rearranged automatically when their minimum size changes.\r\n \t</description>\r\n \t<tutorials>\r\n\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2465254955/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2465260550","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98681#issuecomment-2465260550","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98681","id":2465260550,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6S8OQG","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-08T16:49:49Z","updated_at":"2024-11-08T16:49:49Z","body":"The diff should be good now. It included too much stuff from when I was experimenting at first. Sorry.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2465260550/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2465279180","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98681#issuecomment-2465279180","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98681","id":2465279180,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6S8SzM","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","us